  "task": "I'm managing disruptions caused by multiple elevator failures at Union Station affecting Red Line passengers with mobility issues. Check current elevator statuses and service impacts, plan accessible alternative routes for affected commuters, notify them about options, create urgent maintenance tickets for all faulty elevators, and monitor if delays worsen over the next hour."
